  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "If you've ever thought owning a Clifftop location was out of reach, think again! as my vendor's instructions are clear - it Must Be Sold! This presents a remarkable opportunity to seize your dream Clifftop location right now. This extensive freehold plot spans 2079 square metres and comes complete with its own driveway. With stunning 180-degree sea-views, you'll be treated to breathtaking panoramas stretching across to Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf. Situated centrally in Campbells Bay, this property is a true gem, boasting a generous cliff-top frontage. \r\n\r\nThe building consent was issued for the Construction of a new two-storey dwelling, garage, and pool featuring a bespoke design by Fearon Hay, each offering substantial potential for the construction of luxurious executive residences surrounded by ample grounds and stunning ocean vistas. \r\n\r\nThe existing dwelling on the premises comprises three bedrooms, two bathrooms, and multiple living areas, all enjoying captivating sea views. Additionally, a separate entry downstairs presents an ideal space for extended family or teenagers. \r\n\r\nSituated within excellent school zones, including Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools, and Murrays Bay Intermediate, the property also boasts close proximity to the picturesque beaches of Castor Bay and Campbells Bay, as well as the array of shops, cafes, and restaurants in Milford. Don't miss out on this rare opportunity to develop vast private waterfront land!\r\n\r\nCall Bob today on 021 339 905 to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\n Please copy and paste the following link into your browser to view the listing files: - https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NRGZ",
